### 1. Create a New Venue (Requires Admin Auth)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/venues
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Nelum Pokuna Theatre",
  "addressLine": "110 Anagarika Dharmapala Mawatha",
  "city": "Colombo",
  "capacity": 1280,
  "latitude": 6.9113000,
  "longitude": 79.8647000
}

### 2. Update an Existing Venue (Requires Admin Auth)
PUT {{host}}/api/v1/admin/venues/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Nelum Pokuna Performing Arts Theatre",
  "addressLine": "110 Anagarika Dharmapala Mawatha",
  "city": "Colombo 07",
  "capacity": 1500,
  "latitude": 6.9113000,
  "longitude": 79.8647000
}

### 3. Delete a Venue (Requires Admin Auth)
DELETE {{host}}/api/v1/admin/venues/1
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}


### 1. Create a New Venue - BMICH (Requires Admin Auth)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/venues
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{auth_token}}

{
  "name": "Bandaranaike Memorial International Conference Hall (BMICH)",
  "addressLine": "Bauddhaloka Mawatha",
  "city": "Colombo 07",
  "capacity": 2500,
  "latitude": 6.9012000,
  "longitude": 79.8735000
}

### Test Normal User (Should fail with 403 Forbidden)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/venues
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{user_token}}

{
  "name": "Unauthorized Test Venue",
  "addressLine": "Test Street",
  "city": "Galle",
  "capacity": 100
}